&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We spent a week or 10 days in Zacatecas - arriving from multiple weeks of rural Mexico it was quite a wakeup call. This is a classy city - beautiful, like you&#039;d just arrived in an old European city - Nancy likens it to Florence, Italy, and I think that&#039;s probably reasonable.  We talk about the cultural events we got to see, including concerts, folk music, folk dance, and about the beautiful city of Zacatecas itself, including its history and appearance.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
